{"id": "edb-sorption", "edb": "Sorption", "edbDesc": "The action of both absorption and adsorption taking place simultaneously, i.e. the effect of gases or liquids being incorporated into a material of a different state and adhering to the surface of another molecule. Absorption is the incorporation of a substance in one state into another of a different state (e.g., liquids absorbed by solid or gas absorbed by liquid). Adsorption is the physical adherence or bonding of ions and molecules onto the surface of another molecule.", "wiki": "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sorption", "functions": ["Absorb / Divided Solid", "Absorb / Gas", "Absorb / Liquid", "Accumulate / Divided Solid", "Break Down / Gas", "Break Down / Liquid", "Break Down / Solid", "Change Phase / Divided Solid", "Change Phase / Gas", "Change Phase / Liquid", "Change Phase / Solid", "Clean / Divided Solid", "Clean / Gas", "Clean / Liquid", "Clean / Solid", "Concentrate / Divided Solid", "Constrain / Divided Solid", "Constrain / Field", "Deposit / Divided Solid", "Deposit / Solid", "Detect / Divided Solid", "Detect / Gas", "Detect / Liquid", "Dilute / Divided Solid", "Dry / Divided Solid", "Dry / Gas", "Dry / Liquid", "Dry / Solid", "Expand / Solid", "Extract / Divided Solid", "Extract / Gas", "Extract / Liquid", "Extract / Solid", "Hold / Divided Solid", "Hold / Gas", "Hold / Liquid", "Hold / Solid", "Join / Divided Solid", "Join / Solid", "Move / Gas", "Move / Liquid", "Produce / Divided Solid", "Protect / Divided Solid", "Protect / Gas", "Protect / Liquid", "Protect / Solid", "Purify / Divided Solid", "Purify / Gas", "Purify / Liquid", "Purify / Solid", "Remove / Divided Solid", "Remove / Gas", "Remove / Liquid", "Remove / Solid", "Separate / Divided Solid", "Separate / Gas", "Separate / Liquid", "Separate / Solid"], "title": "Sorption", "year": null, "inventor": "", "location": "", "field": "", "deps": [], "description": "", "effect": "", "usedIn": [], "strength": "", "pick": "drop", "pickWhy": "An umb